		{"se", id=1, file=06071, vol=88},
		{"bg", del=1, path=":cg/03/", file="dc030190022", time=2000},
		{"text"},
		line=1126,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=1127,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=1128,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=1129,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"eval", exp="g.no112=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040010"},
		line=1129,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"To avoid further casualties, we leap across rooftops as we make for the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The Republican Army is likely mustering all the forces it can to pursue us.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"We'll be crushed by sheer numbers if they ever manage to pin us down.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you really have an escape route?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“O-Of course! Worry not, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Kotone stammers out, nearly biting her own tongue as she clings tightly to my back.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Naturally, it'd be hard for non-warriors to move across the rooftops like this.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Though it strains my already tired arms, I had no choice but to carry Kotone on my back.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"A group of enemies lying in ambush on the ground opens up on us as we pass overhead.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"One, then another of my comrades is hit, plummeting to the ground with a sickening crunch.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Khh...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Akari grits her teeth tightly, holding back her urge to cry out.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Just a little bit farther to the Imperial Temple... I'll see Akari there even at the cost of my life!",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, ahead of you!”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I snap my head forward to spot a row of enemy soldiers on the roof in front of us, their rifles aimed straight at us.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, back me up!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Clad in her Spellshield, I lead the charge and fearlessly leap forward into their hail of fire.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ooooooaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Deflecting their bullets with my spellblade, I land right among their ranks.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"I cleave all the soldiers down with a single wide swing of my blade.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haah...! Haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, you are wounded!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I wasn't able to block all the bullets, and suffered a few direct hits as a result.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"But thanks to Kotone's Spellshield, I'm still standing with only a small amount of blood loss.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be fine. Let's keep moving.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Before the words are even out of my mouth, I'm already leaping towards the next building.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"─Don't stop.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"─Just keep moving.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"A helicopter pitches up from between two nearby buildings.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Close enough that I can see the white of the pilot's eyes─",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ruuun!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"A withering barrage of bullets consumes the place I was just standing mere moments ago.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Behind me, my comrades' screams are nearly drowned out by the ear-splitting roar of the machine gun.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"It may be hard for infantry to attack us on the rooftops, but a helicopter has no such issues.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"With no cover to speak of, the most we can do is run and dodge.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"All the while, it relentlessly strafes us with its machine gun as we desperately leap across the rooftops.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"This is no mere infantryman's rifle.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"If those bullets so much as graze me, they'll blow my limbs right off and pulverize the building behind me for good measure.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"In the face of this overwhelming firepower, my remaining comrades are chewed up one after another.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“S-Soujin-sama... we are...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"The only ones left alive are me, Akari, and Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Still, I refuse to give in.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whine all you want once you're dead.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I narrowly avoid the latest strafing run.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The helicopter whizzes over us close enough to graze our heads before circling back around.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"This is the chance I've been waiting for.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I set Kotone down and flip my spellblade around in a reverse grip.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've had your way for long enough.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I lock eyes with the pilot once more.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"But this will be the last time I ever see his face.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ooooooaaaaaaaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I fling my blade with all the might I can muster.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"The spellblade pierces through the heart of the\nhelicopter's engine.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"─It's all over.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Or so I think, but the out-of-control aircraft plummets down straight towards us.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No way!”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Wrapping Kotone and Akari in my arms, I immediately leap for the farthest building I can.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh?!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"But the blast wave from the crash throws off my trajectory.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Missing the mark, the three of us tumble down towards the hard pavement below.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I have to... protect Akari!)”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"In the split second before we land, I kick off the wall of the nearby building in order to fall back-first onto the roof of a parked car.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gh...!”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"The thunderous impact causes me to black out for several seconds.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"At least by some small mercy, there are no Republican soldiers nearby.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari... Kotone, are you okay?!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Just the effort of speaking is enough to cause my entire body to scream.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"We just fell from a ten-story building. I don't even want to think about how many bones I just broke.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah... somehow...”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes... fweeh...”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"The two girls stagger unsteadily to their feet.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank goodness...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"But refusing to give us any time to catch our breaths, the ominous sound of tank treads closes in on us.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Tanks this time, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"There's no way that tanks would operate all alone; they're sure to be supported by infantry as well.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The three of us are all that's left.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"In my current state, there's no way I'll be able to even leap across the rooftops, let alone carry Kotone as well.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"We'll have to break through on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll clear a path. You two hide behind the building.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, that is preposterous!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You cannot possibly fight in such a─”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, keep Kotone safe.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"I meet Akari's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Her limpid eyes are beginning to waver weakly with all manner of emotions.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"But she bites her lip and endures it.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, I put my faith in you.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Akari offers me her own spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That makes it twice I've borrowed this now.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I expect it back, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"I receive the spellblade with both hands.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Rather than a mere blade, though, it feels as though Akari has just bestowed upon me a divine blessing.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Of course, it's just my imagination.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"But even so─",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"There's nothing I need more in this moment than to be able to head unto battle with my head held high.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be back.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"The tank platoon closes in until it's nearly upon us.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I silently draw Yoizuki and fasten the borrowed sheath at my hip.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I will fight.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"To keep my lord's dream alive, I will fight.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"The tank swivels, glaring down at me with its main barrel.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take your best shot.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I deflect the tank shell head-on.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"It veers off harmlessly to my side and explodes in midair.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Riding the blast wave, I dash forward and cleave through the tank's chassis, igniting its fuel storage.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"What was the Republican Army hoping for that tank to accomplish?",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Before a warrior, that thing is nothing but an enormous paperweight.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Or considering that they're sending out their own men in them on one-way trips, it might be more accurate to call them giant metal coffins.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooooaaaaarrrgh!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"I launch a Sickle Leaf into the foundations of a high-rise looming over the side of the road.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Ten stories' worth of glass and rubble rains down upon the column of advancing enemy soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Even before the dust has settled, I dash into the mass of debris and corpses.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"I mercilessly cut down any and all survivors.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"If they shoot at me, I deflect their bullets into their own comrades.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Failing that, I brave their fire head-on and cut them down where they stand.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"I duck and dodge and deflect and cut them down, over and over again.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Of course, I don't make it out unscathed either.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Stray bullets eventually rip away Kotone's Spellshield and find their purchase within my body.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Even so, I sever the searing pain from my consciousness and continue tirelessly swinging my blade.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Without any emotions, without any hesitation, I continue swinging my blade.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"In the midst of this fierce battle, my consciousness drifts away, seemingly dissevered from my corporeal body.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(It's just like that dream I once had...)”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"My ears fill with cries of battle, the resounding sound of steel against steel, the screams and wails of the fallen─",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Amid this crashing symphony of the battlefield, I dance my solitary dance.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"And cut down the encroaching enemy.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Another.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"And another.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"And another. And another.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"And another. And another. And another.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I think of nothing but cutting down the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"There is no end to the battlefield nor the enemies upon it.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"They surge before me as an unceasing tide.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"And in the midst of this billowing storm, I tirelessly swing my blade.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"As if ordained by divine providence, I indefatigably render these living beings into voiceless remains.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Endless hell though this scenery may be, I feel nary a ripple in my heart.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"My mind is free of all obstructive thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"My soul is an unblemished, endlessly pure expanse.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"In this moment, I remember─",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"─I've stood astride countless battlefields just like this.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Once again, wave after wave of Republican soldiers surge before me before being felled in a spray of blood.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Just how many enemies have I slain at this point?",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Just how battered is this body of mine?",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"I know not. All I do is cut down the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Until the battlefield is perfectly still, all I do is cut down the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Have I finally attained the realm of “heart and blade in concord” I once saw in that dream?",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"The dim haze of my consciousness offers me no answer.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"No matter. It matters not either way.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"So long as I can fulfill my duty upon this field.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The next thing I know, all sound has vanished from my surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"All is still and silence.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Only the piled-up heaps of corpses remain.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"This ghastly stillness─",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"─I've stood amidst this exact stillness, amidst the corpses of all those who would oppose me, countless times before.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Akari comes running up to me.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I try to close the distance between us, but my legs refuse to move.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I check to find them pierced by innumerable bullet wounds.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I see. No wonder I couldn't walk.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Suddenly, the tension drains from my body, and I pitch forward unsteadily into Akari's arms.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stay with me, Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama! I shall Heal you at once!”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"A warm sensation washes over my tired body.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Ah... could this be Akari's warmth... Kotone's magicks...?",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry... about me.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"My croaking voice is as hoarse as an old man's.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why would you fight so recklessly?!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I fought... in order to prevail... That's all.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's no reason to─!”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior is nothing more than his lord's blade... Nothing more than a tool...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stop always calling yourself a tool! ...You jerk.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Akari envelops me in her embrace.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Wreathed in the warmth of my lord, I find it terribly difficult to keep my eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"I've fulfilled my duty.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"This body of mine has served its purpose. As long as Akari can get away, I'll have no regrets whatsoever.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari... The Imperial Temple...”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"And then, I lose consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Soujin goes limp in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"His body is so cold that I can scarcely believe he's still alive.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"He's lost too much blood.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"No, it's not just blood loss.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"His bones are shattered, his muscles are torn, his organs are ruptured...",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Every part of him is hopelessly broken...",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, I cannot treat him here! We must make haste to the Imperial Temple, for Soujin-sama's sake as well!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right... That's right!”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Soujin did all he did just to clear a path for us.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"We don't have a second to waste─",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"But as soon as I think this, I spot another group of soldiers closing in on us.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“More... reinforcements?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh...”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"The moonlight glints off the dull metal of their gun barrels.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"There's no doubt about it. They're a unit of the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is this as far as we─”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't be ridiculous!”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I pick up Soujin on my back.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're still alive, aren't we?!”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"The Republican soldiers come to a halt, taking aim at us with their guns.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"They flatly call for our surrender.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"We'll never surrender to the likes of them.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Suddenly, a vehicle barrels through the Republican ranks, aiming straight for us.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Could that be...”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Koujiya Flowers!”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"The familiar shop van skids to a halt right in front of us.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Get in!”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I don't know what the chancellor told you, but I'm on your side!”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“At this point, I don't even care if you're lying or not!”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"With Soujin on my back, I open up the back door and clamber my way in.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, c'mon!”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“O-One moment please!”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"I reach out and grab Kotone by the scruff of her collar.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Floor it!”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?! I'm not in ye─”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aaaaaaaaaaahhhhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"I reel her in as she dangles in the air before slamming the door shut.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"The windshield and walls of the van are immediately riddled with bullet holes.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Shouldn't this thing be bulletproof!?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'm just a florist! What do you expect from me?”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Now then, where did you want this delivery of yours?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Imperial Temple! Super express!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“A fine choice, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It's gonna be a bumpy ride, so hold on tight!”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"The Koujiya Flowers van accelerates and swerves through the storm of gunfire and explosions.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Buffeted by shockwaves from every direction, the vehicle bounces along the road like a toy car.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Whew! I've always wanted to do this at least once in my life!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Once is more than enough for me...”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Well, yeah, I'm with you there.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"A spiderweb of cracks spreads across the shot-up windshield.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"The manager casually punches the entire window out to the side of the road.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Now then, whether we live or die is completely up to fate to decide!”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You two better start praying to Oomikami!”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Leave it to me! It's what I am best at!”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"The van eventually comes to a screeching halt at the entrance to the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Kotone tumbles out of the vehicle, and I follow her with Soujin on my back.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Manager, thank you so much!”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The enemy is right behind us. You should come with us too!”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“If I leave the van abandoned here, they'll be able to pinpoint your location right away.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I may be past my prime, but at least grant me this chance to act the hero.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"The moment the words leave the manager's mouth, he sets the van in reverse.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“The chancellor had good reasons for entrusting the fate of the Empire to you.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Good luck with everything.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"The manager's forehead is dripping with sweat.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Despite the darkness, I can see the blotches of crimson starting to spread across his abdomen.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"But I force myself to not say another word.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"He, too, is living for his own fealty.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“At any rate, we look forward to your continued patronage at Koujiya Flowers!”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"The van screeches off into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's get going. We shouldn't let the manager's courage go to waste.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Right this way!”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"The two of us dash through the halls of the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"We arrive at the same room where she once Honed a spellblade for us.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Sitting upright in the center of the room is a thick ring of thatched grass about as wide as I am tall.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“One moment, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Kotone steps before the ring of dried grass and murmurs an invocation.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"The inside of the ring begins to glow, and I can no longer see through it to the other side.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"The closest thing that it resembles is an enormous, glowing mirror.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“On the other side of this portal lies Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Iseya?!”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then why didn't we just─”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is only capable of transporting about five souls at most.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is why I could not volunteer it for the Sworn Blades' plan.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But that is beside the point. We must make haste!”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"As if to lead by example, Kotone leaps head-first into the shimmering ring.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"It's been over half a year since I set foot in Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Yet here I find myself, fleeing to Iseya again with so much still left unfinished.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"Inou, Kanami, Elsa, Shino, Koyuzu, Mutsumi, Kazuma, Mr. Manager...",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Please, keep yourselves safe.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"And wait for us─",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"Because, someday, no matter what, we shall return.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, let's go!”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Clasping the still-unconscious Soujin's hand in my own, I leap into the ring of grass.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"I follow Elsa-sama back to my familiar room.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Only then do I realize that she's wounded.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Her blood is still steadily dripping to the floor, so her wounds can't be shallow.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, allow me to treat you.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No need. Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"She casually wipes the blood from her cheek with the back of her hand.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"In that moment, the ever-graceful Elsa-sama looks every bit as gallant as any warrior I've known.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republican Army will be here any minute. If you make one wrong move, your life will be forfeit.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have long since been prepared for that.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't you dare.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Elsa-sama fixes me with a fierce glare.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“For the sake of the Empire, you have to stay alive. Stay alive and hold out hope.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun will definitely come back for us.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Until that day comes, the two of us have to survive. ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Together.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"Her sincere words burrow their way deep into my heart.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"I'm suddenly reminded of the day Elsa-sama approached me with a proposition to vanquish Okonogi “together.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"The difference between the Elsa-sama back then and the one standing before me now is night and day.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"Thinking back on it now, it should have been painfully obvious just how insincere she was back then.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"If I allowed her to string me along, it must have been because I was tired of serving as the chancellor's puppet.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"But from now on, things will be different.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Until the day Miyaguni-sama returns to claim her rightful throne, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I am the",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Empress.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"...And the people need me.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"For the sake of the Empire's future, I shall serve with all my heart and soul.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Let us survive together.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"I clasp Elsa-sama's hands in my own.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"From this moment on, the two of us are a false Empress and a Republican officer no longer.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"The two of us are true compatriots.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"The ominous sound of military boots approaches from the corridor.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"I meet eyes with Elsa-sama and show her a resolved nod befitting a worthy Empress.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"The two of us will survive. I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" survive.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Until the day Onii-sama returns─",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
